Paper example 073: Dimension-safe matrix multiplication

#paper: 73
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
matmul(r in Nat, k in Nat, c in Nat): func(
    x: Matrix(number, r, k), y: Matrix(number, k, c),
) -> Matrix(number, r, c): {
    rows: x.rows
    cols: y.cols
    data: [
        for row in x.data {
            [for j in list.Range(0, y.cols, 1) {
                dot(row, [for yrow in y.data {yrow[j]}])
            }]
        }
    ]
